.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Parse blosum from the given file data
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fBfile\fB \fR\- The blosum text data or text file path.. 
.PP
.SH VALUE
.PP
a [Blosum](cref:T:SMRUCC.genomics.Analysis.SequenceAlignment.BestLocalAlignment.Blosum) amino acid substitution score matrix object that 
 parsed from the given blosum text data. When this function is called 
 with no arguments, then the built-in \fBBlosum-62\fR score matrix will be 
 returned.
